{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "be16eccb5a4da005599049db04eb088e5bc8ad4aeabd423ca11d253974d5bdb4", "ja": "最高のサプライズを求めて", "zh": "追求最棒的惊喜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ae2cf4418b337c396d493d1e3abfb3614e6479fe0fc70fb67f3c5da8e52a7671", "ja": "新曲のお披露目公演を控えて\n観客へのサプライズ演出の練習として\nプロデューサーへのサプライズを仕掛けた\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "新歌首次亮相公演即将到来，\n这是偶像们为了练习如何给观众惊喜，\n而捉弄制作人的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d0b4b8ed1cbee69bc5d2e1f2f9758f420cea9202e04eaccc7a810a81351fd60", "ja": "（今日は新しい曲のお披露目ライブだ。メンバーには\n衣装に着替えてもらっているんだけど……、遅いな）", "zh": "（今天是新歌的首次亮相演唱会，我让参加成员\n去换表演服装了，可是……她们好慢啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1001_201xxx", "source_sha256": "f729e801dded29fe5fc3e08b4aafbe496ea39c47cb82f10acbab4168ff6e582b", "ja": "はい、……ですね♪", "zh": "嗯……对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "d718f5b99fd526512e2e8904ccffda8f071a2d27fefdccf6456d6cebd889cc60", "ja": "ええ、手筈通りに。……ですから。", "zh": "是啊，跟计划的一样，因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "18db394db1013fb5ab2bb1ba343e8e655c0f5ba390d260c43fb31388e1595651", "ja": "（ん？　部屋から声が……。\n何をヒソヒソと話しているんだ？）", "zh": "（嗯？房间里有说话声……\n她们偷偷摸摸在说什么？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1004_201xxx", "source_sha256": "46321b25bd48b9610f4958830d0ad12119be3bd908e9b1c8e8377f4cfb7ce2cc", "ja": "皆さん、この間のお話ですけど……。\n移籍のこと、考えてくれましたか？", "zh": "大家，关于我之前提到的事……\n你们有考虑要跳槽了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "116ee1dabf3225009700c8e99c532fd479c8792d0dd4d98459b50ecd306ae7b2", "ja": "うん……、自分すっごく悩んだけど……、\nほんとにいぬ美をアイドル犬にしてくれるんだよね？", "zh": "嗯……本人非常犹豫……\n你真的会让汪美成为狗狗偶像吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1006_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c6b2b27838b9ff74bc747d56e5f20b513dcd38b65daf2542b02266fe5f4f80b8", "ja": "もちろん♪　いぬ美ちゃんだけじゃなくて\n響ちゃんの家族全員でアイドルデビューだよ！", "zh": "那当然♪不仅是汪美，\n响的家人全部都会一起以偶像身分出道喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "40bb1ff306142aa2aed5fba1177c690489650b4e14fa8c6dd8c804bc057972e7", "ja": "なら、自分……！　でも～、うう……！\nうぎゃー！　こんなの決められないぞ！", "zh": "那样的话，本人……！可是～唔唔……！\n呜呀──！这种事好难决定喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "50235951df5689866aa8c19b20364c2d1748391fb2056e5d16b546a2671dba0e", "ja": "詩花……、私もあなたの事は妹のように\n親しく思っています。ですが……。", "zh": "诗花……小女子也把你当作妹妹一样看待，\n但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "bbe52bbbcf58bd374d122ca276cfbb7c0af73929a79236c87db4480cdc379ca6", "ja": "ミキも、{$P$}といっしょじゃ\nなきゃ、ヤ。だからごめんね、詩花。", "zh": "美希也是，美希不想跟{$P$}分开。\n所以对不起喔，诗花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "0d1b5701dfa81ee71e264eb08fdbb51ff5e52d5708e7a528f202bd06981265af", "ja": "でしたら、{$P$}さんもご一緒に！　\nいちごババロアとラーメンも食べ放題にしちゃいます！", "zh": "那就邀请{$P$}先生一起跳槽！\n还会准备草苺巴巴露亚跟拉面让大家吃到饱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1011_201xxx", "source_sha256": "da5c0c65493b96dea96be5818335b2cde2103acf4f074faecf998032fe52afa1", "ja": "それでも、ダメですか？　\n貴音さ……いえ、貴音お姉さま。", "zh": "就算这样，还是不行吗？\n贵音小……不，贵音姊姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "cc838df58acbc78ddb84ba47e0f34db580e7e5de7293e971b7e78ecad70c0bb0", "ja": "……移籍いたします。", "zh": "……小女子决定跳槽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "4fc0fc0933904ab25a0ebe4029340c134dbcf7fc5f3a3aa8509a8357db9b3300", "ja": "するの！", "zh": "美希也要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "5d585a3e9d653d86747127a75beeba38129a23b8eb07906f9f7e2be347e7d90f", "ja": "ええ～！　じゃ、自分もいくぞ～！", "zh": "什么～！那本人也要一起去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_1015", "source_sha256": "476cdd55e7cf314bf178d6aa51c3e4200db536e4cb68e8c20018ea1a8f89d78d", "ja": "ちょっと待った！", "zh": "等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4f7b4d1a09e5716a82efe09a1a778d39bfc6099c740807149fb4376e9eae237b", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待った！\n話はすべて聞かせてもらったぞ！", "zh": "等、等一下！\n你们刚刚说的话我都听到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "75899f8d72a3c4a3c1ed59d1a1f10868c489c5ce999c7ba0f859ba6a8550ad84", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。いいところにきたの！\nね、いっしょに詩花のとこ、いこ？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。你来得正好！\n欸，跟美希我们一起到诗花那里去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2002_p", "source_sha256": "58601a476d971c172f9f3992447bb5ecacfb0ed146907d43354607394884a50f", "ja": "な、何を言っているんだ、美希！\n響も貴音も、移籍だなんて……。", "zh": "你、你在说什么啊，美希！\n响跟贵音也是，竟然说要跳槽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2003_008tak", "source_sha256": "a92f10dfa7f040a9477cd2eb9e2c5cdc1656e4dcab3cb37490ca44f5d028610c", "ja": "なんと、聞いておられたのですね。\n盗み聞きとはお人の悪い……。", "zh": "原来你都听见了啊。\n偷听这种行为不太好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2004_013hib", "source_sha256": "690263154e649312fdd04f3e959fe1fa51c64160e5d07f7f65b4daaf9250f6b0", "ja": "そもそもノックなしで入るなんてマナー違反だぞ。\nヘンタイか、ヘンタイなのか！", "zh": "而且竟然门都没敲就直接进来，太没礼貌了喔。\n你是变态吗！你难道是变态吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2005_201xxx", "source_sha256": "797e2d80c07bc3b3154f15bd7318e45459e7c6ab8beda50fd756d3977bea679b", "ja": "はっ、たしかうちの社長も「765プロには\n変態プロデューサーがいるから近寄るな！」って……。", "zh": "啊，记得我们社长也说过\n「765艺能有个变态制作人，别靠近他！」这种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2006_p", "source_sha256": "466cfef5b6c579ba6051a02bcf3f76f5203b3404d0fb6faeb9b77648a5094779", "ja": "それは誤解だ！　いや、それよりも詩花。\n3人を引き抜くつもりなのか？", "zh": "那是误会！不，先不讲这个了，诗花。\n你想挖角她们三个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2007_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c9892d2a34a4377e8a28124fcb362167c1b93f5ecade5b6b946d12193cac5575", "ja": "{$P$}さんもいかがですか？\n私、社長を説得しますから！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也一起来怎么样？\n我会说服社长的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2008_003mik", "source_sha256": "e09e88d0ea6e92eb82b6471b6b62cef7ea44a851f030cefd0d957f18eda9888b", "ja": "ごめんね、{$P$}……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "8c310e40b00001bfca0052cd145e47af3e769fb9a1cdfffb4a188cdf28ff5dff", "ja": "3人とも、本気なのか。そんな……。", "zh": "你们三个都是认真的吗？怎么会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2010_003mik", "source_sha256": "f7325a21351ee260305f9a8ef20e7ed26799ab29e314c3c3f957c6cce196ba31", "ja": "これ、ドッキリなの。", "zh": "美希我们只是在整你唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2011_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2012_013hib", "source_sha256": "3431b0635aa2ced20d34876b597a7e2c2e46674ae5d1b0de2d27a4aa8eadd764", "ja": "あ～、美希～！　ばらすのが早すぎるぞ！\nもうちょっと引っ張る予定だったでしょ～！", "zh": "啊～美希～！你太快把真相说出来了！\n原先的计划不是要再拖延一下的吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2013_008tak", "source_sha256": "6995ac5dd3234740c0bf111a1c88b0ccf7decaf1f7d127cdf404456a10bdb540", "ja": "ふふっ、申し訳ありません。本日のライブの演出に\nさぷらいずを取り入れようと悩んでいまして。", "zh": "呵呵，真是抱歉，我们原本在烦恼今天的演唱会表演\n要怎么带给观众惊喜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2014_003mik", "source_sha256": "6c79b85039eb4d49a374ddcef938bd6a4d142b7ee3b2b2813b523d4471a6f901", "ja": "それで詩花に聞いてみたら、サプライズには\nドッキリが大事じゃないかって。どう、おどろいた？", "zh": "美希我们就问了诗花，然后她说惊喜的重点应该在\n要让人吓一跳。怎么样？你有吓到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2015_p", "source_sha256": "ef39a9b683af277f45909a001a8611ee561fa513ffabf8239cffbede6eaa8bb7", "ja": "当たり前だろ。……まあ、こんなのでサプライズの予行\n演習になったのならいいけど……。いや、よくないか。", "zh": "当然吓死了……算了，如果这样能当成你们\n惊喜演出的彩排就好……不，其实也不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2016_201xxx", "source_sha256": "400bd02e31e205c04bb93ef22a7abf4b8722295a3266c3c74c88a454b91a1641", "ja": "ふふっ、ごめんなさい。少しやりすぎちゃいました。\n最初はこんなに凝るつもりはなかったんですけど。", "zh": "呵呵，抱歉，我们有些做过头了。\n其实一开始没有打算演得这么认真啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2017_013hib", "source_sha256": "cd626d0e3ce8ea6299914654a6603893020aa9facea9bc526680ba96624bf59f", "ja": "演技してるうちに、どんどん力が入っちゃったんだ～。\n意外とバレなかったみたいだね！", "zh": "不过在演戏的时候，不知不觉就越来越卖力了～\n好像没有漏馅，好意外喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2018_008tak", "source_sha256": "2a775faf9edbcbcbef69580c3db03ecc0a1443b7a5e807831253bf2e3395a88d", "ja": "それだけ私たちを信頼してくださっている\nということでしょう。真、ありがたきことです。", "zh": "这代表制作人对我们就是如此信赖吧。\n着实感激不尽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2019_003mik", "source_sha256": "defc5f0106d6f5140359c60067a5f1d2503895a5d7eef72cf0cd7fdee305b461", "ja": "ね、{$P$}。もしほんとに\nミキたちが詩花のとこいっちゃったら、どうする？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}，要是美希我们\n真的跳槽到诗花那里去，你会怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2020_p", "source_sha256": "0c9a3dec4ca62cf7f1ec6425f05c0cc816a3010b75cdd5330a795aa26309602c", "ja": "そうだな。\nもし本当にそうなったら、その時は……。", "zh": "这个嘛。\n如果真的有那么一天，我会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_2021", "source_sha256": "31fac97a33a42f54c43142d94eb92f2b4cc7f7d48a9f8a74e12cfcd3a9072437", "ja": "引き抜き返す！", "zh": "把你们挖角回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3000_p", "source_sha256": "d423f2f09b4a04872aa41181229a5b45b334fae0a269aba215ff2ce9292af8ec", "ja": "引き抜き返すよ。3人は765プロがよく似合ってるし\n3人のことを一番知ってるのは俺だ。", "zh": "把你们挖角回来喔。你们三个很适合765艺能，\n而且最了解你们的人也是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3001_p", "source_sha256": "89e40236c6d41c46f6546e71f9d1a1f633e0d6af6668c0ec95602e5e58de0b44", "ja": "黒井社長のようにコネや実績はないかもしれないけど、\n一緒に悩んで努力して、トップまで導いてみせる。", "zh": "或许我没有黑井社长那样的人脉与成就，但我会跟你们\n一起烦恼、一起努力，把你们培养成顶尖偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3002_p", "source_sha256": "55ae7d05d8950252aef1c912368d2aa84b82526e705f300e29080800f8775b66", "ja": "だから、これからも765プロにいてくれ。\n俺も精いっぱい、みんなを支えていくから。", "zh": "所以，请你们今后继续待在765艺能。\n我也会尽全力继续支援大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3003_013hib", "source_sha256": "e6f3e9955e6b29725b4659c6cc7baea2edbc73fdce207ec59fcc25678920ed1d", "ja": "と、とーぜんだぞ！　自分も\n765プロが好きだし、これからもよろしくね！", "zh": "那、那是当然的喔！\n本人也很喜欢765艺能，以后也请多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3004_008tak", "source_sha256": "98035d1efa85d877b147f5b06e4d50f4316fd6c85bea23b1a5ddc0d6a119f346", "ja": "私も、トップアイドルという高みまで\n導いてくださるのはあなた様だけと信じております。", "zh": "小女子也相信只有官人能够带领小女子\n前往顶尖偶像的境界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3005_003mik", "source_sha256": "da111e5b63f1364aca2ff13846e841a0dd30b036f3027dcf2b75cda7636b1cdb", "ja": "これからもよろしくね、ハニー♪", "zh": "以后也请多指教啰，HONEY♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3006_201xxx", "source_sha256": "767d60f4203073397820690e89b4b27b4f55546eb3c36faa817c548fcd0f8d96", "ja": "さすが{$P$}さん。皆さんと\nほんとに仲良しなんですね。ふふっ、うらやましいな。", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生。\n你跟大家的感情真的很好呢。呵呵，真令人羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3007_201xxx", "source_sha256": "d823c4faab706f4b4dcb3dbfbed83a6331b22bffda2e77248348b092eac1facc", "ja": "でも……とってもお似合いだと思います♪\n今日のステージも、観客席から応援してますね！", "zh": "不过……我觉得你应该就要这个样子♪\n今天的表演，我也会在观众席上帮大家加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3008_p", "source_sha256": "d5296c044080f4bff7d17587ed3d1ed99736cfb5424a6dee1a14811bd60c4460", "ja": "さて、詩花も席に戻ったし、そろそろ時間だな。\nみんな、準備はいいか？", "zh": "好，诗花已经回观众席去了，时间也差不多了。\n大家，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3009_013hib", "source_sha256": "5735f32f216e7659b42564c03ce728039fcc349bcb1b0cd3a3a76c5ebb02cb97", "ja": "うん、バッチリだぞ！　\nって、あれ、何か自分たち忘れてるような……？", "zh": "嗯，准备周全喔！\n……咦？我们是不是忘了什么东西……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3010_008tak", "source_sha256": "4051037cbd75d7725d0b4d24e0b0faac7059fe0065b7ae947e621672dc0c0c71", "ja": "さぷらいずの件がまだ決まっていませんね。\n今からでは、間に合いそうにありませんが……。", "zh": "我们还没决定好要给大家什么惊喜。\n不过现在开始想好像也来不及了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3011_013hib", "source_sha256": "9c8fa108ab190628225acc9c1a1517bccbcbb2034008169062a5c31027e2e7ff", "ja": "ああっ、そうだった！　ど、どうするんだー！　\nこれじゃ自分たちのライブが～！", "zh": "啊啊，本人都忘了！怎、怎么办才好──！\n这样下去我们的演唱会就～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3012_p", "source_sha256": "6a9bf0b60ab3e03d03226a4b4c225690eb800b020f75547bc6d10d506426f0e7", "ja": "サプライズか……。それじゃ、今日は3人の\n最高の自分を見せる、っていうのはどうだ？", "zh": "惊喜吗……那今天就把最棒的自己展现给大家看，\n你们觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3013_003mik", "source_sha256": "d5e09744591f2b60873b5a32ffb6d91fc699e5e18f3228a1c12caca53124e980", "ja": "さいこうの、ミキたち？", "zh": "最棒的美希我们？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3014_p", "source_sha256": "6c075c6866b510e5b05cdfe939720695710cf964cd2209dd932b281cdc8f11ad", "ja": "ファンのみんなへの一番のサプライズは\n見たことがないほどの、最高のパフォーマンスだ。", "zh": "今天你们要为粉丝带来最大的惊喜是，\n他们从没见过的、最棒的精湛演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3015_p", "source_sha256": "2625780ce1d7821bba57eee34e94841f87d9c33d938dc674eba9b426326b0687", "ja": "3人はもう十分な実力があるけど、だからこそ、\n過去を超える最高のステージで、みんなを驚かそう！", "zh": "你们三个已经拥有足够的实力，但正因如此，\n更要用超越过去的绝佳表演，为大家带来惊奇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3016_008tak", "source_sha256": "1d4ac5cee85b9e48a691da54a2f6c2e9f776a327190fb933f2a7a07469ab2466", "ja": "過去を超えてこそ、さぷらいず。かしこまりました。\nファンの皆様に最高の私を届けて参りましょう！", "zh": "正因超越过去才叫做惊喜……小女子明白了。\n就为粉丝献上小女子最杰出的表现吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3017_013hib", "source_sha256": "644b87f4cd1e190f35a09a65ae691d7d36ec921aeb1b8e33e9cc7aa25b2453a5", "ja": "うんっ、自分カンペキだけど、今日はもっとカンペキに\nやってみせるっ。見ててよねっ！", "zh": "嗯，虽然本人原本就很完美，\n但今天会表现得更加完美的！你要好好看着喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_014_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_014_fc_01_3018_003mik", "source_sha256": "8bdc754ba43690a59e8d2b86036efe8282fb133261abfd94623862e642ac9115", "ja": "ミキも、昨日のミキには負けないって思うな！\nあはっ☆　それじゃ、行ってくるね♪", "zh": "美希也不会输给昨天的美希喔！\n啊哈☆那美希我们上场啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
